* Independent ngspice-native reproduction of the vendor's public inverter
* transfer law and RC output stage. Not copied from the proprietary simulator;
* source waveforms are archived separately from the original TI PSpice file.
.subckt SR_TI_INVERTER OUT IN PARAMS: td=0 tt=2n
Blogic drive 0 V=u(0.51-v(IN))
Rstage drive OUT 10
Cout OUT 0 {(td + 0.5*tt)/6.93}
.ends SR_TI_INVERTER
